    "把「获取 URL 内容」下载的汇率数据导入 REC，资产页按主要币种换算净资产。App 自己不联网。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imports rates downloaded with Get Contents of URL into REC, so Assets can show your net worth in your primary currency. REC itself never goes online."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把「获取 URL 内容」下载的汇率数据导入 REC，资产页按主要币种换算净资产。App 自己不联网。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把「取得 URL 的內容」下載的匯率資料匯入 REC，資產頁會依主要幣別換算淨資產。App 本身不連網。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把收到的银行短信或邮件交给 REC，在本机解析、匹配账户、去重并入账。不会打开 App，也不联网。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Passes a bank text message or email to REC, which reads it on this iPhone, matches the account, skips duplicates and records it. REC doesn’t open and never goes online."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把收到的银行短信或邮件交给 REC，在本机解析、匹配账户、去重并入账。不会打开 App，也不联网。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把收到的銀行簡訊或郵件交給 REC，在本機解析、配對帳戶、去除重複並入帳。不會打開 App，也不連網。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拆出去的单独显示，分类保留。没选的还是一单，只剩一笔时就不再是一单了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Split-off transactions show on their own and keep their categories. The rest stay together; an order with one transaction left is no longer an order."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拆出去的单独显示，分类保留。没选的还是一单，只剩一笔时就不再是一单了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拆出去的會單獨顯示，分類保留。沒選的仍是同一筆訂單，只剩一筆時就不再是訂單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
